      `the application includes the name and address of the provider` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the application is lodged by an authorised representative` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the application includes the name and address of the authorised representative` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Annex VII point 3.1(a) the application includes the name and address of the provider and of the authorised representative` MEANS
