-- src:1807 | 3.1. The application of the provider shall include:
-- src:1808 | (a) the name and address of the provider and, if the application is lodged by an authorised representative, also their name and address;
-- src:1809 | (b) the list of AI systems covered under the same quality management system;
-- src:1810 | (c) the technical documentation for each AI system covered under the same quality management system;
-- src:1811 | (d) the documentation concerning the quality management system which shall cover all the aspects listed under Article 17;
-- src:1812 | (e) a description of the procedures in place to ensure that the quality management system remains adequate and effective;
-- src:1813 | (f) a written declaration that the same application has not been lodged with any other notified body.
@ref Annex VII point 3.1 (src:1807-1813)
-- The combiner: the application includes everything the list names when every limb answers JUST TRUE; a limb that answers JUST FALSE makes it JUST FALSE.
GIVEN `the answers of the limbs` IS A LIST OF MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Annex VII point 3.1 the application of the provider includes everything listed given the answers of the limbs` MEANS
    IF `the answers of the limbs` EQUALS EMPTY
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (silent): no limb was answered
    ELSE IF any (GIVEN `an answer` YIELD `an answer` EQUALS JUST FALSE) `the answers of the limbs`
         THEN JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The application of the provider shall include" each limb listed (a bare "shall" not done)
         ELSE IF all (GIVEN `an answer` YIELD `an answer` EQUALS JUST TRUE) `the answers of the limbs`
              THEN JUST TRUE
              ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (silent): at least one limb is not answered on the facts given, and none is unmet

