§ `Annex VII point 3.3: keeping the approved quality management system`

-- src:1817 | 3.3. The quality management system as approved shall continue to be implemented and maintained by the provider so that it remains adequate and efficient.
@ref Annex VII point 3.3 (src:1817)
-- Gloss: once approved, the provider goes on implementing and maintaining the quality management system so that it stays adequate and efficient. Before approval the point says nothing.
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk`
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the quality management system has been approved` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the provider continues to implement the quality management system` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the provider continues to maintain the quality management system` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the quality management system remains adequate` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the quality management system remains efficient` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Annex VII point 3.3 the provider has kept the approved quality management system implemented, maintained, adequate and efficient` MEANS
