§ `Annex VII: the regulative rules`

-- Every rule below has no time limit and no stated consequence, so no trace can show it breached (NOTES.md, "Rules with no breach path").
-- Each takes the four inputs of the keel's gate; before Annex VII applies to the AI system, nothing is owed.

-- src:1814 | 3.2. The quality management system shall be assessed by the notified body, which shall determine whether it satisfies the requirements referred to in Article 17.
@ref Annex VII point 3.2 (src:1814)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk`
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Annex VII party` `Annex VII act`
`Annex VII point 3.2 the duty of the notified body to assess the quality management system and determine whether it satisfies Article 17` MEANS
    IF (NOT (`Annex VII the group of Article 43 applies to the AI system on the date asked` `the date asked` `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`)) OR (`Annex VII Article 2(2) cuts Article 43 off from the AI system` `the date asked` `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation`)
    THEN FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed before Annex VII applies to the AI system, or where Article 2(2) says that Article 43 does not apply to it (fork F-S14-reach)
    ELSE PARTY `Annex VII notified body`
         MUST `Annex VII 3.2 assess the quality management system and determine whether it satisfies the requirements referred to in Article 17`
         HENCE FULFILLED

